OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over #42m Senedd office
OL,4,Ablock renovation as parliament's budget
OL,5,Apassed
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform's Cai Parry-Jones has criticised
OL,8,Fthe plans, telling the BBC the proposed
OL,9,Fexpansion of the office block, TE7
OL,10,FHywel, was unnecessary.
